  title: Wounded Knight
  image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: bee66d52dd0c5994ea9bf9cab186c0bd, type: 3}
  eventDescription: 'As you enter this floor, you see a wounded knight laying on
    the ground. You can hear their agonizing whimpers as you approach. You could
    offer a helping hand if you can heal them... or offer them mercy with a swift
    death. '
  randomCardsAvailable: 5
  conditions:
  - _requirementString: An attack will give them a swift death.
    _successString: You choose to offer mercy to the knight. They give one last peaceful
      look before expiring.
    _failString: You refuse to finish the knight.
    _filter:
      rid: 5880775371356110871
  - _requirementString: A card that heals will recover their vitality.
    _successString: You heal the knight slightly. They offer you a thankful nod before
      heading upwards to the next floor. There is no other way out of the Nocturnal
      Beacon, after all.
    _failString: You did not heal the knight.
    _filter:
      rid: 5880775371356110872
  questEnd: With your decision, you carry on to the next floor.
  rewards:
